766 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I am a student at The Game Assembly\054 during my time studying I have\054 in addition to taking courses\054 been involved in the creation of 7 games\054 and developed my specialization work in simulating the physics of fluids\056\nAs a result of this I\047ve developed a good amount of experience in working with various different kinds of people in teams\056 \nAs my time at TGA is coming to a close I am now looking to being able to get the opportunity to find a 30 week internship as a game programmer\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
