770 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Education\072\nTGA \0502024\0552026\051\nMy current Education\054 Specifics are listed in the TGA section\056\nStockholm University  \0502021\0552022\051\nI completed several courses from the first year of a bachelor\031s degree in physics\056\nServed as a compelling introduction to many more physics concepts\054 and complicated maths\056\n\305va \0502016 \055 2019\051\nUpper Secondary school \050Gymnasiet\051 where I took an education focused on the natural sciences\056\nBasic foundation in the natural sciences\054 and maths\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 771 0 R
     /Pg 761 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
