774 0 obj
  << /ActualText (TGA\072\nSpecialization\072\nExplored methods for simulating physical phenomenon\056\nLaid out my own plan and had to adapt accordingly to sickness and complications\056\nLearned to make use of my experience from learning physics in the context of programming\056\nProjects 5\0557\072\nMade use of and contributed to developing an ECS structure\056\nLearned to implement Audio through Wwise\056\nDeveloped and polished a visual scripting system in order to allow Level designers and others to create gameplay\056\nProjects 3\0554\072\nLearned to implement audio using FMOD\056\nCreated a robust collision system which could handle sloped surfaces\054 really thin platforms\054 and high velocities\056\nProjects 1\0552\072\nIntroduction to working in groups and general programming\056\nProvided some basic but structured knowledge on how to use Unity and C\043\056)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 775 0 R
     /Pg 761 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
